{
    "title": "2nd Phone Number - Call & Text",
    "description": "TalkU gives you a second phone number so you can call and text without revealing your private number. This phone number app is perfect for work, dating, and social media signups.\r\n\r\nWhy Use TalkU?\r\n*Make Wi-Fi calls and send SMS messages.\r\n*Save on international calling and texting.\r\n*Turn your tablet into a phone.\r\n*Enjoy high-quality calls between mobile phones and landlines.\r\n*Enjoy cheap international calls\r\n\r\nUseful Features\r\n*Send text messages to any phone number worldwide.\r\n*Keep 2nd or multiple numbers at the same time.\r\n*Avoid roaming costs, even when calling from abroad.\r\n*Call & text over Wi-Fi or cellular data\r\n\r\nText and Call App\r\nStop paying for expensive cell minutes and SMS text messages!\r\nGet a phone number by earning credits. \u00a0 \r\n\r\nCrystal Clear Calls\r\nVoice calls are transmitted over TalkU's high-quality dedicated VoIP network.\r\nHD voice technologies ensure superior clarity.\r\n\r\nAmazing Premium Features\r\n*Visual voicemail with instant listening.\r\n*Block unwanted calls to stop spammers.\r\n*Call screening. \u00a0 \r\n*Call forwarding to any phone number.\r\n\r\nNotes\r\n*You can earn credits for calls and texts.\r\n*TalkU utilizes internet calls (aka Wi-Fi calls, IP calls, or VoIP calls), which require a data connection.\r\n\r\nSubscription Terms\r\nPayment will be charged to your Google Account upon confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each term unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can cancel a subscription anytime through your Google account settings. This must be done 24 hours before the end of a subscription period to avoid being charged. \u00a0 \r\n\r\nLearn more at http://www.talkyou.me\r\nNeed Help? http://talkyou.me/support\r\n\r\nStop giving out your own number! Pick a second phone number and enjoy cheap texting & calling!",
    "descriptionHTML": "TalkU gives you a second phone number so you can call and text without revealing your private number. This phone number app is perfect for work, dating, and social media signups.<br><br>Why Use TalkU?<br>*Make Wi-Fi calls and send SMS messages.<br>*Save on international calling and texting.<br>*Turn your tablet into a phone.<br>*Enjoy high-quality calls between mobile phones and landlines.<br>*Enjoy cheap international calls<br><br>Useful Features<br>*Send text messages to any phone number worldwide.<br>*Keep 2nd or multiple numbers at the same time.<br>*Avoid roaming costs, even when calling from abroad.<br>*Call &amp; text over Wi-Fi or cellular data<br><br>Text and Call App<br>Stop paying for expensive cell minutes and SMS text messages!<br>Get a phone number by earning credits. \u00a0 <br><br>Crystal Clear Calls<br>Voice calls are transmitted over TalkU&#39;s high-quality dedicated VoIP network.<br>HD voice technologies ensure superior clarity.<br><br>Amazing Premium Features<br>*Visual voicemail with instant listening.<br>*Block unwanted calls to stop spammers.<br>*Call screening. \u00a0 <br>*Call forwarding to any phone number.<br><br>Notes<br>*You can earn credits for calls and texts.<br>*TalkU utilizes internet calls (aka Wi-Fi calls, IP calls, or VoIP calls), which require a data connection.<br><br>Subscription Terms<br>Payment will be charged to your Google Account upon confirmation of purchase. Subscriptions automatically renew at the end of each term unless auto-renew is turned off at least 24 hours before the end of the current period. You can cancel a subscription anytime through your Google account settings. This must be done 24 hours before the end of a subscription period to avoid being charged. \u00a0 <br><br>Learn more at http://www.talkyou.me<br>Need Help? http://talkyou.me/support<br><br>Stop giving out your own number! Pick a second phone number and enjoy cheap texting &amp; calling!",
